msgstr "Fleur"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1430
msgid "Flower (Rose)"
msgstr "Fleur (Rose)"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1431
msgid ""
"Quest Item:  The skull of the old Dwarf King, Zokarr IV.  It doesn't look particularly impressive."
msgstr ""
"Objet de la Quête : c'est le crâne du vieux roi des Nains, Zokarr IV. Il n'a pas l'air si impressionnant."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1431 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2087
msgid "Skull"
msgstr "Crâne"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1431
msgid "Zokarr IV's Skull"
msgstr "Le Crâne de Zokarr IV"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1432
msgid "A human(?) thigh bone."
msgstr "C'est un fémur, sans doute humain."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1432
msgid "Thigh Bone"
msgstr "Fémur"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1433
msgid "Haldar's Remains"
msgstr "Restes d'Haldar"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1433
msgid ""
"Quest Item:  This strangely shaped jar resists all attempts to open or break.  Haldar apparently doesn't like to be disturbed."
msgstr ""
"Objet de la Quête : cette jarre à la forme étrange résiste à toute tentative d'ouverture. Haldar n'aime visiblement pas être dérangé."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1434 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1455
msgid "Bottle"
msgstr "Bouteille"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1434
msgid "Elixir"
msgstr "Elixir"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1434
msgid "Quest Item:  A glowing elixir of obviously magical properties."
msgstr ""
"Objet de la Quête : c'est un élixir phosphorescent aux propriétés magiques."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1435
msgid ""
"Apples like these are produced by trees saturated by magic-- usually in the elven lands of Avlee and the Tularean Forest, though not restricted to these areas.  To use the apple, pick the apple up and left-click over the picture of your character in the inventory screen."
msgstr ""
"Ces pommes-là proviennent d'arbres saturés de magie, généralement plantés dans les terres Elfiques d'Avlee ou de la forêt de Tulare. Pour utiliser cette pomme, prenez-la et cliquez avec le bouton droit de la souris sur le portrait de votre personnage dans l'Inventaire."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1435
msgid "Red Apple"
msgstr "Pomme Rouge"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1436
msgid ""
"Quest Item: This hat appears to belong to a more affluent member of society, the feather is genuine and the construction is solid.  Unfortunately, it doesn't seem to fit."
msgstr ""
"Objet de la Quête : ce chapeau appartient sans doute à un notable, sa plume est superbe et sa confection remarquable. Malheureusement, il ne semble pas à votre taille."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1436
msgid "Wealthy Hat"
msgstr "Chapeau d'Apparat"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1437 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1438 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1439
msgid "Instrument"
msgstr "Instrument"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1437 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:766
msgid "Lute"
msgstr "Luth"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1437
msgid ""
"Quest Item: This lute has been masterfully crafted and lovingly maintained.  This instrument clearly belongs to a Bard."
msgstr ""
"Objet de la Quête : ce luth magistralement fabriqué et amoureusement entretenu appartient visiblement à un Barde."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1438
msgid "Faerie Pipes"
msgstr "Cornemuse Enchantée"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1438
msgid ""
"Quest Item:  Though finely crafted and deceptively simple-looking, these Pipes are quite difficult to play; they seem to have a mind of their own."
msgstr ""
"Objet de la Quête : cette cornemuse est difficile d'usage en dépit de sa belle réalisation et de son apparente simplicité, comme si elle avait sa volonté propre."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1439
msgid "Gryphonheart's Trumpet"
msgstr "Trompe de Gryphonheart"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1439
msgid ""
"Quest Item:  An artifact from a previous Elf/Human dispute, lost by Terrance Gryphonheart in a daring night-time raid by Elvish forces.  Rumor has it that no army that has fought on the side of this trumpet's music has ever been defeated.  Even if the rumor is false, it will certainly boost morale on either side."
msgstr ""
"Objet de la Quête : cet objet datant des conflits entre Elfes et Humains fut volé à Terrance Gryphonheart au cours d'un raid audacieux des forces Elfiques. On murmure qu'une armée encouragée par les sonneries de cette trompette ne peut être battue. Même si la rumeur est fausse, ses fanfares seront sûrement bénéfiques au moral."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:144
msgid ""
"A ring set with three amethysts. The largest is an excellent stone - richly and evenly purple with a perfect cut."
msgstr ""
"Anneau serti de trois améthystes. La plus grosse est une pierre d’une excellente qualité, d’un violet profond et limpide, parfaitement taillée."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:144
msgid "Amethyst Ring"
msgstr "Anneau d’améthyste"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1440
msgid ""
"Quest Item: Seashells this large are only found on the beaches of Emerald Island.  One of these might make a nice souvenir of your time here."
msgstr ""
"Objet de la Quête : on ne trouve de si impressionnants coquillages que sur les plages de l'Ile d'Emeraude. L'un d'eux pourrait vous faire un joli souvenir."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1440 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:769
msgid "Seashell"
msgstr "Coquillage"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1441
msgid "Floor Tile (w/ moon insignia)"
msgstr "Dalle (w/ insigne lunaire)"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1441
msgid ""
"Quest Item: This tile was apparently part of the library in a Temple of the Moon."
msgstr ""
"Objet de la Quête : cette dalle provient visiblement de la bibliothèque du Temple de la Lune."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1441
msgid "Tile"
msgstr "Dalle"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1442
msgid ""
"(+100 Speed, +50 Accuracy, +50 Air Resistance, Regenerate SP and HP over time, and Feather Falling) Rumored to be the footwear of a god, the winged sandals confer enormous power on the wearer."
msgstr ""
"(+100 de Vitesse, +50 de Précision, +50 de Protection contre l'Air, Régénère les PdS et les PdV progressivement, et Poids Plume) On dit qu'il les chaussures d'un dieu. Les Sandales Ailées confèrent un extraordinaire pouvoir à celui qui les porte."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1442
msgid "Winged Sandals"
msgstr "Sandales Ailées"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1443
msgid ""
"Quest Item: The Seasons' Stole is worn by priests during seasonal festivities.  Though it doesn't have any direct power, most commonfolk believe it grants luck in the planting or harvest."
msgstr ""
"Objet de la Quête : l'Etole des Saisons est portée par les prêtres lors du Sacre des Saisons. Quoique sans pouvoir direct, elle accroîtrait la chance."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1443
msgid "Scarf"
msgstr "Echarpe"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1443
msgid "Season's Stole"
msgstr "Etole des Saisons"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1444
msgid "Golem chest"
msgstr "Cage Thoracique de Golem"

