# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:57
msgid ""
"No Regnan ship leaves port without a cache of tridents. Boarding attacks against their galleys seldom succeed against massed walls of their erudine tines."
msgstr ""
"Aucun navire regnan ne quitte le port sans une réserve de tridents. Les abordages lancés contre leurs galères réussissent rarement, repoussés par les rangs serrés de leurs dents d’érudine."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:57
