msgstr "Corne de vouivre"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:644
msgid "Ogre Key"
msgstr "Clé d’ogre"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:645
msgid "Pirate Hat"
msgstr "Chapeau de pirate"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:645
msgid ""
"Quest Item: A sea raider captain's hat. Inside the band are stitched the words \"D. P. Stanley.\""
msgstr ""
"Objet de quête : chapeau de capitaine écumeur des mers. A l’intérieur du ruban sont brodés les mots “ D. P. Stanley ”."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:646
msgid "Fruit"
msgstr "Fruit"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:646
msgid ""
"The fruit of the tobersk bush which only grows on the Dagger Wound Islands. It is the main export item of the islands' Lizardmen."
msgstr ""
"Le fruit de l’arbuste de tobersk qui pousse uniquement sur les îles de la Plaie de la Dague. C’est la principale marchandise exportée de ces îles par les hommes-lézards."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:646
msgid "Tobersk Fruit"
msgstr "Tobersk"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:647
msgid "Pulp"
msgstr "Pulpe"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:647
msgid "Pulp made from Dagger Wound Islands grown tobersk fruit."
msgstr ""
"Pulpe obtenue à partir des fruits de tobersk qui poussent sur les îles de la Plaie de la Dague."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:647
msgid "Tobersk Pulp"
msgstr "Pulpe de tobersk"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:648
msgid "Brandy"
msgstr "Brandy"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:648
msgid ""
"Brandy made from the processed pulp of Dagger Wound Islands grown tobersk fruit."
msgstr ""
"Brandy produit à partir de la pulpe transformée des fruits de tobersk qui poussent sur les îles de la Plaie de la Dague."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:648
msgid "Tobersk Brandy"
msgstr "Brandy de tobersk"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:649
msgid "Heartwood of Jadame"
msgstr "Duramen de Jadame"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:649
msgid ""
"The cooler climate of the Murmurwood forest causes the trees there to grow with a tight grain. These lumbered planks are of the clear grained heartwood."
msgstr ""
"Grâce au doux climat de la forêt de Murmurwoods, les arbres qui y poussent ont une texture serrée. Ces planches débitées sont constituées du duramen à la texture homogène."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:649
msgid "Wood"
msgstr "Bois"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:65
msgid ""
"A light crossbow of good quality, these weapons feature a grooved table, basic sights and a smooth releasing nut."
msgstr ""
"Arbalètes légères de bonne qualité, ces armes comportent un plateau rainuré, des mires simples et une détente souple."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:65
msgid "Blood Drop Crossbow"
msgstr "Arbalète de Goutte de sang"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:650
msgid ""
"A crate of from the Shadowspire artificers. Small flaws in workmanship have made them incapable of holding enchantments."
msgstr ""
"Coffre d’amulettes imparfaites issues des artificiers de Shadowspire. De petits défauts de fabrication les ont rendues incapables de détenir des enchantements."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1497 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1498 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1499
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1500 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1501 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1502
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:650 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:651 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:652
msgid "Crate"
msgstr "Caisse"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:650
msgid "Flawed Amulets"
msgstr "Amulettes imparfaites"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:651
msgid ""
"A crate of dried sunfish harvested from the Ifarine Sea. Some find the chewy, salty fish a delicacy."
msgstr ""
"Coffre de poissons-lunes séchés pêchés dans la Mer Ifarine. Difficile à mâcher, ce poisson salé est un mets délicat pour certains."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:651
msgid "Dried Sunfish"
msgstr "Poissons-lunes séchés"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:652
msgid ""
"A crate full of bagged Silver Dust. Made by the Necromancers' Guild, it is said to have value to some sea travelers."
msgstr ""
"Coffre rempli de poussière d’argent en sacs. Produite par la Guilde des nécromanciens, on dit qu’elle a de la valeur pour certains navigateurs."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:652
msgid "Silver Dust of the Sea"
msgstr "Poussière d’argent de l’océan"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:653
msgid "Forged Vouchers"
msgstr "Fausses quittances"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:653
msgid ""
"Forged credit documents used by the ogre mage Zog to embezzle gold from Alvarian merchant customers."
msgstr ""
"Faux avoirs utilisés par Zog, l’Ogre mage pour escroquer de l’or aux marchands d’Alvar."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:653
msgid "Vouchers"
msgstr "Quittances"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:654
msgid "A powerful potion reagent used by the Necromancers of Shadowspire."
msgstr ""
"Puissant réactif de potion utilisé par les nécromanciens de Shadowspire."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:654
msgid "Ground Wyvern Horn"
msgstr "Corne de vouivre moulue"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:655
msgid "Prophecies of the Snake"
msgstr "Prophéties du Serpent"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:655
msgid ""
"Quest Item: One of many books of prophecy circulating recently, the Prophecies of the Snake may indeed tell the future of Jadame."
msgstr ""
"Objet de quête : l’un des nombreux livres de prophétie récemment diffusés, les Prophéties du Serpent pourraient prédire l’avenir de Jadame."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:656
msgid "Ear"
msgstr "Oreille"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:656
msgid "Ogre Ear"
msgstr "Oreille d’ogre"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:656
msgid ""
"Used to keep track of kills, some bounty hunters collect these gruesome reminders of battles past."
msgstr ""
"Utilisés pour compter les ogres tués, ces sinistres souvenirs d’anciennes batailles sont collectionnés par certains chasseurs de primes."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:657
msgid "Stinger"
msgstr "Dard"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:657
msgid "The stinger of a giant wasp."
msgstr "Le dard d’une guêpe géante."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1435 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2107 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:658
msgid "Apple"
msgstr "Pomme"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:658
msgid "Green Apple"
msgstr "Pomme verte"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:658
msgid ""
"Jadamean green apples are crunchy, slightly tart and a good source of nutrition.  (To use the apple, pick it up and left-click over a character's portrait in the inventory screen.)"
msgstr ""
"Croquantes et légèrement acidulées, les pommes vertes de Jadame constituent une bonne source de nutriments. (Pour utiliser la pomme, sélectionnez-la, puis cliquez sur le portrait d’un personnage à l’aide du bouton gauche de la souris dans l’écran d’inventaire.)"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1451 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2086 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:659
msgid "Horseshoe"
msgstr "Fer à Cheval"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:659
msgid ""
"This flawless horseshoe is made of silver. To use, pick the horseshoe up and right-click over a character's portrait."
msgstr ""
"Ce fer à cheval parfait est en argent. (Pour utiliser le fer à cheval, sélectionnez-le, puis cliquez sur le portrait d’un personnage à l’aide du bouton droit de la souris.)"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:66
msgid ""
"Built for use in the field, this medium crossbow is designed for hunting, but is equally effective as a battle weapon."
msgstr ""
"Conçue pour une utilisation sur le terrain, cette arbalète moyenne est faite pour la chasse mais elle est tout aussi efficace comme arme de combat."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:66
msgid "Hunting Crossbow"
msgstr "Arbalète de chasse"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:660
msgid ""
"A pretty bauble favored by the Pirates of Regna for it appearance, not for any magical enchantment it may have."
msgstr ""
"Jolie babiole appréciée par les Pirates regnans pour son apparence, et non pour un éventuel enchantement magique."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:660 assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/tables/english/potion.txt:119 assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/tables/english/potion.txt:120
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/tables/english/potion.txt:121 assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/tables/english/potion.txt:122 assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/tables/english/potion.txt:123
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/tables/english/potion.txt:124 assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/tables/english/potion.txt:125
msgid "Enchanted Amulet"
msgstr "Amulette enchantée"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:661
msgid ""
"Quest Item: A wheel of prized unicorn's-milk frelandeau cheese. Sliced onto crackers, it is the perfect compliment to a snifter of fine tobersk brandy."
msgstr ""
"Objet de quête : meule de fameux frelandeau au lait de licorne. En tranches sur des biscuits salés, c’est le parfait accompagnement d’un petit verre de bon brandy de tobersk."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:661 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:803
msgid "Wheel of Frelandeau"
msgstr "Meule de frelandeau"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:662 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:804
msgid "Log of Eldenbrie"
msgstr "Bûche d'eldenbrie"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:662
msgid ""
"Quest Item: A log of Vori eldenbrie cheese. Though many have tried to duplicate its subtle, smoky flavor, only the master Frost Giant cheese masters of the frozen Vori wastes know the secrets of its formulation."
msgstr ""
"Objet de quête : bûche d’eldenbrie de Vori. Beaucoup ont essayé de reproduire son goût subtil et fumé, mais seuls les maîtres fromagers des géants du Gel des déserts de Vori connaissent les secrets de sa recette."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:663 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:805
msgid "Ball of Dunduck"
msgstr "Boule de dunduck"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:663
msgid ""
"Quest Item: A ball of dunduck cheese. Made in small batches by the goblins of Erathia, most consider it an acquired taste."
msgstr ""
"Objet de quête : boule de dunduck. Fabriqué par petits lots par les gobelins d’Erathia, la plupart pense qu’on y prend goût."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:664
msgid "Emperor Thorn's Key"
msgstr "Clé de l’empereur Thorn"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:664
msgid "Quest Item: The key you took from the Unicorn King's body."
msgstr "Objet de quête : la clé prise sur le corps du Roi des licornes."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:665
msgid "Cannonball"
msgstr "Boulet de canon"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:665
msgid "Cannonball of Dominion"
msgstr "Boulet de canon de dominion"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:665
msgid ""
