# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:8
msgid "Champion's Sword"
msgstr "Epée de champion"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:8
msgid ""
"These are made exclusively for members of the Erathian Order of the Blade. Since by tradition they are buried with their fallen wielders on hallowed and guarded grounds, they are rare articles indeed."
msgstr ""
"Ces épées sont réservées aux membres de l’Ordre de la lame d’Erathia. La tradition veut qu’à la mort de leurs détenteurs, elles soient enterrées à leurs côtés en terre bénie et gardée. Ce sont donc des objets très rares."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:80
msgid ""
"The Trolls of the Ironsand Desert make these clubs by fire-hardening the fantastically tough root wood of the thornbark tree."
msgstr ""
"Les trolls du Désert du sable de fer fabriquent ces massues en faisant durcir au feu le bois de racine incroyablement robuste de l’arbre à écorce épineuse."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:80
msgid "Thornbark Club"
msgstr "Massue d’écorce épineuse"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:800
msgid "message scroll 797"
msgstr "message sur parchemin 797"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:801
msgid "message scroll 798"
msgstr "message sur parchemin 798"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:802
msgid "message scroll 799"
msgstr "message sur parchemin 799"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:803
msgid ""
"A wheel of prized unicorn's-milk frelandeau cheese. Sliced onto crackers, it is the perfect compliment to a snifter of fine tobersk brandy."
msgstr ""
"Meule de fameux frelandeau au lait de licorne. En tranches sur des biscuits salés, c’est le parfait accompagnement d’un petit verre de bon brandy de tobersk."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:804
msgid ""
"A log of Vori eldenbrie cheese. Though many have tried to duplicate its subtle, smoky flavor, only the master Frost Giant cheese masters of the frozen Vori wastes know the secrets of its formulation."
msgstr ""
"Bûche d’eldenbrie de Vori. Beaucoup ont essayé de reproduire son goût subtil et fumé, mais seuls les maîtres fromagers des géants du Gel des déserts de Vori connaissent les secrets de sa recette."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:805
msgid ""
"A ball of dunduck cheese. Made in small batches by the goblins of Erathia, most consider it an acquired taste."
msgstr ""
"Boule de dunduck. Fabriqué par petits lots par les gobelins d’Erathia, la plupart pense qu’on y prend goût."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:806
msgid "Crude Longsword"
msgstr "Epée Longue Grossière"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:806
msgid ""
"Though notched and dented, this longsword is still an effective weapon."
msgstr "Encore qu'émoussée, cette arme est encore très efficace."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:807
msgid ""
"A common elven weapon, this saber is a deadly, if unremarkable, weapon."
msgstr ""
"Commun chez les Elfes, ce sabre est mortel à défaut d'être exceptionnel."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:807
msgid "Elven Saber"
msgstr "Sabre Elfique"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:807
msgid "Saber"
msgstr "Sabre"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:808
msgid ""
"Although this longsword appears quite old, the edge of the blade is unusually sharp.  It was quite probably enchanted to remain that way during its creation."
msgstr ""
"Cette épée peut paraître vieille, mais son tranchant est très acéré. Pour rester si efficace, sans doute a-t-elle été enchantée."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:808
msgid "Keen Longsword"
msgstr "Epée Longue Ardente"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:809
msgid ""
"A high quality longsword, monogrammed initials near the base of the pommel indicate it was forged by master weaponsmith Mekorig the Blind circa 780-800."
msgstr ""
"Cette épée est de grande qualité, comme l'atteste le monogramme du Maître Forgeron Mekorig l'Aveugle, gravé sur le pommeau. Elle a été fabriquée aux alentours de 780-800."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:809
msgid "Graceful Sword"
msgstr "Epée Gracieuse"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:81
msgid "Overlord's Club"
msgstr "Massue de chef suprême"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:81
msgid ""
"Troll tribal chieftains must win their position through trial by combat. The winner keeps his club as a symbol of office. The losers' clubs often find their way into the weapon marketplace."
msgstr ""
"Les chefs de tribu des trolls doivent gagner leur titre au combat. Le gagnant garde sa massue en guise d’insigne. Les massues des perdants sont souvent vendues sur le marché des armes."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:810
msgid "Duelist Blade"
msgstr "Fleuret de Duel"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:810
msgid ""
"These rare blades were forged sometime before the Silence, and have been used by noble duelists who want to die in style for centuries.  No two are quite alike, but all share bloody histories."
msgstr ""
"Ces lames rares ont été forgées avant la Période de Silence et ont été utilisées par les duellistes les plus nobles dans leur quête d'une mort esthétique. Elles sont toutes différentes, mais ont toutes vu des événements sanglants."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:811
msgid ""
"This simple two-handed sword with a leather grip is a common design in Erathia."
msgstr ""
"Cette simple épée à deux mains à poignée de cuir est assez commune sur Erathia."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:812
msgid ""
"An effective, deadly design employed by less well disciplined armies throughout time.  The smith of this particular two-handed sword thoughtfully added a blood groove down the center of the blade."
msgstr ""
"Le dessin mortellement efficace de cette épée à deux mains plaît aux armées les plus sauvages. Le forgeron a veiné celle-ci d'une rigole d'écoulement du sang."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:812
msgid "Great Sword"
msgstr "Grande Epée"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:813
msgid "Heroic Sword"
msgstr "Epée Héroïque"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:813
msgid ""
"It is thought by some master swordsmen that a wavy blade is a bit stronger than a straight one, and does more damage when it strikes an opponent.  That may or may not be true, but one thing is certain--this particular sword's craftsmanship is amongst the finest you've ever seen."
msgstr ""
"La plupart des Maîtres d'Armes pensent que ce genre de lames courbes infligent plus de blessures que les lames droites. Difficile de dire si c'est vrai, mais une chose est sûre : ce sabre a l'un des dessins les plus fins qui soient."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:814
msgid "A polished broadsword commonly used by all forces in Erathia."
msgstr "Une épée communément utilisée par les forces d'Erathia."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:815
msgid "A fine Erathian steel broadsword of excellent quality and edge."
msgstr "Une fine épée érathienne de bonne qualité."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:815
msgid "Steel Broadsword"
msgstr "Epée Large d'Acier"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:816
msgid "Master Broadsword"
msgstr "Epée de Champion"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:816
msgid ""
"More a falchion than a broadsword, this magnificent weapon retains a keen edge in spite of its age."
msgstr ""
"C'est un cimeterre plus qu'une épée, et malgré son âge cette arme reste un bel outil de combat."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:817
msgid ""
"The swept-back style of the cutlass helps opponents underestimate the weapon's true reach.  Many unexperienced swordsmen have lost their lives to this deceptive design."
msgstr ""
"Ce coutelas ne paie pas de mine, mais on aurait tort de le sous-estimer. Beaucoup d'hommes d'armes ont perdu la vie en commettant cette erreur."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:818
msgid ""
"A strange mix of brass and some other, reddish metal provide this weapon with its strange color and unusual strength.  Goblin craftsman are typically unconcerned with appearance, but when it comes to killing, they can be counted on to get it right."
msgstr ""
"L'étrange couleur et la puissance impressionnante de cette arme viennent de son mélange d'acier et d'étrange métal rouge. Les Gobelins se moquent de l'esthétique des objets, mais ils savent rendre une lame tranchante !"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:818
msgid "Goblin Cutlass"
msgstr "Coutelas Gobelin"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:819
msgid ""
"Cleverly concealed initials near the pommel of this cutlass prove this beautiful weapon to be the work of Alec Teling, master smith to Hareck IX, Lord of Regna, and emperor of the Endless Ocean."
msgstr ""
"Des initiales finement gravées sur le pommeau indiquent que ce coutelas fut dessiné par Alec Teling, Maître Forgeron d'Hareck IX, Seigneur de Regna, Empereur de l'Océan sans Fin."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:819
msgid "Exquisite Cutlass"
msgstr "Coutelas Regnan"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:82
msgid "Journey Staff"
msgstr "Bâton de voyage"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:82
msgid ""
"Many dangers face the Jadamean traveler. Even the least battle-minded carry some sort of weapon. These iron ended walking sticks are a common choice."
msgstr ""
"Le voyageur de Jadame doit affronter de nombreux dangers. Même les moins belliqueux portent une arme ou une autre. Ces cannes à embout de fer sont un choix courant."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/Global.txt:274 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1666 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1667
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1668 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:82 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:83
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:84 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:85 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:86
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:866 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:867 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:868
msgid "Staff"
msgstr "Bâton"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:820
msgid "A crude dagger found in the hands of thieves and ruffians everywhere."
msgstr "Une simple dague pour brigands et mauvais garçons."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:820
msgid "Improvised Dagger"
msgstr "Dague"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:821
msgid "Dwarven Dagger"
msgstr "Dague Naine"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:821
msgid ""
"More like a short sword to a dwarf, this dagger is an excellent example of superior dwarven engineering and inferior artistic creativity."
msgstr ""
"Sorte d'épée courte de Nain. Ce coutelas témoigne du génie technique des Nains et de leur laisser-aller artistique."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:822
msgid "Sharktooth Dagger"
msgstr "Dague dentelée"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:822
msgid ""
"The 'blade' of this dagger is really a sharks' tooth taken from the waters of the Quiet Ocean and mounted on a fancy handle.  It is very sharp and light."
msgstr ""
"La lame de cette dague est une véritable dent de requin trouvée dans les eaux de l'Océan Paisible. Montée sur une poignée de fantaisie, cette lame est coupante et légère."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:823
msgid "Assassin's Dagger"
msgstr "Dague d'Assassin"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:823
msgid ""
"The crosspiece of this dagger folds in to make concealment easier.  A spring in the pommel snaps the crosspiece out very quietly when the dagger is drawn from its sheath."
msgstr ""
"Dessinée pour tenir au mieux dans la main, cette dague a pour particularité de se dégainer silencieusement et facilement."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:824
msgid ""
"A weapon from the Time of Wonders, it is no longer possible to achieve a sharper or stronger edge."
msgstr ""
"Nul ne peut plus égaler la robustesse et le tranchant de cette arme des Temps des Merveilles."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:824
msgid "Wonder Dagger"
msgstr "Dague de Mage"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:825
msgid "Shoddy Long Dagger"
msgstr "Dague Longue"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:825
msgid ""
"The long dagger combines the extra reach of the sword with the stealth of the dagger."
msgstr ""
"Cette longue dague cumule la portée de l'épée et la maniabilité du coutelas."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:826
msgid "Erathian Long Dagger"
msgstr "Dague Longue Erathienne"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:826
msgid ""
"This long dagger is outwardly reminescent of the smaller Erathian daggers made using shark teeth, but its edge is unmistakably steel. The construction is sturdy and reliable and the blade is every bit as deadly as the shark tooth -- except it holds an edge better and is easier to resharpen."
msgstr ""
"Moins une dague qu'une courte épée, cette lame pourrait être enchantée."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:827
msgid "Exquisite Long Dagger"
msgstr "Dague Longue Merveilleuse"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:827
msgid ""
"The spare, yet appealing design of this long dagger is typical of pre-Silence artifacts.  This particular style was very popular at the time, but since more than a thousand years have passed, few remain.  Like everything from the time of the Silence, it looks as new as the day it was made."
msgstr ""
"Le dessin sobre mais fascinant de cette arme est typique de l'ère pré-Silence. Ce style était courant il y a un millénaire, mais peu de ces armes restent en circulation. Elles paraissent pourtant indémodables."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:828
msgid "Crude Axe"
msgstr "Hache Grossière"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:828
msgid "This primitive axe is more like a simple tool than a weapon."
msgstr "Cette hache primitive ressemble davantage à un outil qu'à une arme."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:829
msgid "Battle Axe"
msgstr "Hache de Combat"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:829
msgid ""
"The flared edge of the blade is a common style used by low budget human armies and bandits."
msgstr ""
"Ce type d'armes est courant parmi les humains pauvres et les bandits de petite envergure."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:83
msgid "Orb Staff"
msgstr "Bâton à orbe"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:83
msgid ""
"This staff is topped with a head of polished turquoise to give it greater striking force."
msgstr ""
"Ce bâton est surmonté d’une tête de turquoise polie qui lui confère une plus grande puissance de frappe."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:830
msgid "Dwarven Axe"
msgstr "Hache Naine"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:830
msgid "Typical Dwarven manufacture:  Strong, practical, and plain."
msgstr ""
"On reconnaît ici une fabrication naine typique : force, efficacité, simplicité."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:831
msgid ""
"One of several crates full of such axes stolen from the Dwarves by the Warlocks of Nighon.  Each of these weapons has been tempered and enchanted by the Stone City foundry, and stamped with their mark."
msgstr ""
"L'une des innombrables caisses de haches volées aux Nains par les Magiciens de Nighon. Chacune de ces armes a été enchantée par la fonderie de la Cité de Pierre. Leur estampille le prouve à jamais."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:831
msgid "Steel Axe"
msgstr "Hache d'Acier"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:832
msgid ""
"Double bladed axes like these are powerfully enchanted by Minotaur sorcerers in a secret process known only to them.  These axes are light where they should be heavy, and slice through metal armor as easily as they slice through cloth."
msgstr ""
"Les sorciers Minotaures sont seuls à connaître le moyen d'enchanter puissamment ces haches à double tranchant. Elles en deviennent infiniment plus légères et tranchent les armures comme du beurre."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:832
msgid "Minotaur Axe"
msgstr "Hache de Minotaure"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:833
msgid "Poleaxe"
msgstr "Merlin"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:833
msgid ""
"This style of long hafted axe has better reach and more power than the normal one-handed axe."
msgstr ""
"Ces haches à long manche ont plus de puissance et portent plus loin que les haches classiques."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:834
msgid ""
"This poleaxe has a sharper blade equipped with all the latest in military technology:  Blood grooves, whistle-holes, and a counterbalanced, smaller blade behind the haft for tricky, disembowling, backstrokes."
msgstr ""
"Cette hache bénéficie d'un dessin tranchant et des dernières avancées de la technologie militaire : un contrepoids, des rigoles d'écoulement du sang, un équilibre parfait et une seconde lame de petite taille doublant la première pour mieux mordre la chair."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:834
msgid "Warrior's Poleaxe"
msgstr "Merlin de Guerrier"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:835
msgid "Headsman's Poleaxe"
msgstr "Hache de Bourreau"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:835
msgid ""
"So named for the execution device favored by headsmen, the Headsman's Poleaxe sports a longer blade to reduce messy and embarassing execution mistakes."
msgstr ""
"Ainsi nommée pour sa bonne tenue pendant les exécutions, la Hache du Bourreau possède une plus longue lame pour éviter les ratages dans les décollations."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:836
msgid "Crude Spear"
msgstr "Lance Grossière"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:836
msgid ""
"Though constructed with a head of sharpened rock lashed to a rough stick, this spear can cause serious damage. (+1D9 if used two-handed)."
msgstr ""
"Simplement constituée d'un morceau de pierre attaché à un bout de bois, cette lance peut quand même occasionner des dégâts importants (+1D9 si on l'utilise à deux mains)."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:837
msgid "Soldier's spear"
msgstr "Lance de Soldat"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:837
msgid ""
"Spears like this are found in all armies where their versatility as both pole and melee weapons are demonstrated regulary."
msgstr ""
"Ces lances sont populaires dans toutes les armées où on s'en sert comme armes de jet autant que comme armes de mêlée."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:838
msgid "Elven Spear"
msgstr "Lance Elfique"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:838
msgid ""
"Elven weapons are almost always as graceful as they are practical.  The spear's style and elegance have not come at the expense of practical qualities such as the sturdy attachement of head to haft, nor the choices of metal and haft grip."
msgstr ""
"Les armes elfiques sont généralement aussi gracieuses qu'efficaces. Le choix du métal et la solidité de la hampe prouvent que la finesse de l'arme n'ôte rien à ses qualités au combat."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:839
msgid "Cruel Spear"
msgstr "Lance Cruelle"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:839
msgid ""
"The triangular shape of the spear head leads to especially painful wounds that do not heal easily or well.  Runic enchantments inscribed along the haft suggest enchantments that enhance the cruel effect of the triangular head."
msgstr ""
"La tête triangulaire de cette lance inflige des blessures particulièrement difficiles à soigner. Des enchantements runiques gravés sur la hampe rendent encore plus douloureux les coups portés par la pointe."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:84
msgid "Priestly Staff"
msgstr "Bâton de prêtre"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:84
msgid ""
"This finely decorated staff is the product of Lizardman craft. Wrapped with exotic leathers, and ended with a bronze footcap and striker, these staves are carried by Lizardman priests as a symbol of station."
msgstr ""
"Ce bâton aux décorations raffinées est l’œuvre des hommes-lézards. Enveloppés de cuirs exotiques et dotés d’un embout percuteur en bronze, ces bâtons sont portés par les prêtres hommes-lézards en signe de leur rang."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
# fan text corrected (Claude)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:840
msgid ""
"A smithy symbol and date stamp indicate this spear was made in the magical forges of Governor Padish 12 years before the Silence."
msgstr ""
"Un poinçon indique que cette lance fut produite dans les forges magiques du gouverneur Padish 12 ans avant le Silence."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:840
msgid "Sublime Spear"
msgstr "Lance Sublime"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:841
msgid ""
"Like all Halberds, this weapon is basically an axe with a very long haft.  It's a versatile weapon--doubling as a spear when fighting room is tight, or a staff when personal defense is needed.  This one is of ordinary worksmanship and materials."
msgstr ""
"Comme toutes les hallebardes, cette arme est grossièrement une hache montée sur une longue hampe. Elle a le double usage de la lance à longue distance et du bâton dans les mêlées au corps à corps."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:841
msgid "Old Halberd"
msgstr "Hallebarde"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:842
msgid ""
"The haft of this halberd has been cored, and filled with a lead rod.  When the weapon is swung, the lead rod slides to the blade end of the halberd with a loud crack, adding force and weight to the blow."
msgstr ""
"Un poids de métal a été glissé dans la hampe creuse de cette hallebarde. Lorsque l'arme est manoeuvrée, l'inertie lui confère une plus grande énergie et une puissance accrue."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:842
msgid "Weighted Halberd"
msgstr "Hallebarde Lourde"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:843
msgid ""
"A small stamp on the blade of this weapon indicates it was constructed in the famous Mekorig Foundry by the master himself, Mekorig the Blind.  You would be hard pressed to find a finer Halberd anywhere in the world"
msgstr ""
"Grâce à la marque gravée sur l'arme, nous savons que cette hallebarde a été forgée dans la fameuse fonderie Mekorig par le Maître lui-même, Mekorig l'Aveugle. Vous n'en trouverez jamais de meilleure."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:843
msgid "Mighty Halberd"
msgstr "Hallebarde Puissante"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:844
msgid ""
"A variant of the farmer's pitchfork, the trident had been used by spear fishermen since time began.  Now it is the traditional weapon of sea-going warriors throughout the world."
msgstr ""
"Adapté de la fourche des fermiers, le trident est resté des siècles l'instrument de travail des pêcheurs. Il est devenu l'arme des guerriers qui croisent dans les océans du globe."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:844
msgid "Crude Trident"
msgstr "Trident"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:845
msgid "Barbed Trident"
msgstr "Trident à Barbelures"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:845
msgid ""
"Improving on the basic trident design, the tips of the tines have rough, backwards facing barbs.  This designs causes much more damage as the weapon is pulled from the victim."
msgstr ""
"Pour améliorer le dessin initial du trident, on a ajouté à cette arme des pointes en forme de barbelures. En retirant l'arme du corps de la victime, on crée des dommages irréparables."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:846
msgid ""
"A style favored by the Imerial Regnan Navy, the two side tines of the war trident are thin and sharp to make slashing as easy as stabbing.  To further impress enemies, the tines are gilded in brass, and the haft painted yellow, giving the appearance that the Regnans are fighting with golden weapons."
msgstr ""
"Appréciée dans la Marine Impériale de Regna, ce trident de guerre possède des pointes extérieures affinées pour en faire de véritables baïonnettes. La décoration, cuivre et peinture jaune, imite la texture de l'or pour mieux impressionner les ennemis."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:846
msgid "War Trident"
msgstr "Trident de Guerre"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1647 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:847
msgid ""
"A simple longbow constructed of common materials and uninspired design."
msgstr "C'est un arc simple, primitif et dessiné sans goût."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:847
msgid "Crude Bow"
msgstr "Arc Grossier"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1647 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1648 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1649
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1650 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1651 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:847
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:848 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:849 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:850
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:851
msgid "Longbow"
msgstr "Arc Long"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:848
msgid ""
"A higher quality long bow designed after the elven long bow, but without the elven skill."
msgstr ""
"Cet arc long de bonne facture imite les armes elfiques sans posséder néanmoins leur perfection technique."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:849
msgid "Elven Longbow"
msgstr "Arc Long Elfique"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:849
msgid ""
"Etched initials at the base of the bow indicate this bow was made by master bowyer Ivan Selving's workshop during the Timber Wars of the late 600's."
msgstr ""
"Les initiales gravées sur le bois de cet arc indiquent pour armurier Ivan Selving, Maître en son art dans les années 600, pendant la Guerre du Bois."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:85
msgid "Serpent Staff"
msgstr "Bâton serpent"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:85
msgid ""
"These rare staffs may appear unwieldy, but they are the product of sorcery. In combat they flex with animal intelligence to work in blows through their targets' defenses."
msgstr ""
"Ces bâtons rares peuvent paraître peu pratiques, mais ils sont le fruit de la sorcellerie. Au combat, ils se contorsionnent avec une intelligence animale pour faire passer des coups au travers des défenses de leurs cibles."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:850
msgid "Composite Bow"
msgstr "Arc d'Alliage"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:850
msgid ""
"Composite bows are made of a variety of materials and pieces, instead of a single piece of wood.  They are generally more flexible and powerful than regular bows."
msgstr ""
"Les arcs d'alliage sont faits de plusieurs matériaux et de nombreuses pièces au lieu de n'être constitués que d'un simple morceau de bois. Ils sont généralement plus efficaces et plus souples que les arcs traditionnels."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:851
msgid "Griffin Bow"
msgstr "Arc Griffon"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:851
msgid ""
"The grisly materials used in this bow--a griffin's skull and tough spine--make for a surprisingly tough and powerful bow.  Needless to say, the materials are hard to harvest, and griffins fight back much harder than Yew trees."
msgstr ""
"Cet arc est étonnamment solide et puissant grâce aux os de griffon qui ont servi de matériau de base à sa fabrication. Ces arcs sont rares : il est plus facile de prendre un peu de bois à un arbre qu'un crâne à un griffon."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:852
msgid ""
"Although crossbows have many advantages--locking string catches, superior shot strength, easy to learn--they don't compare to the longbow when speed and range are critical."
msgstr ""
"Bien que les arbalètes aient de nombreux avantages (crans pour la corde, puissance accrue, facilité d'utilisation), elles ont une moindre portée que l'arc et ne peuvent s'utiliser aussi rapidement."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:852
msgid "Crude Crossbow"
msgstr "Arbalète"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:853
msgid "Heavy Crossbow"
msgstr "Arbalète Lourde"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:853
msgid ""
"These crossbows were stockpiled by Archibald just prior to the Succession War for use against his brother.  As with most decisions involving death, Archibald chose wisely.  These crossbows are amongst the best in the land."
msgstr ""
"Ces arbalètes furent stockées par Archibald juste avant la Guerre de Succession pour mieux combattre son frère. Comme toujours dans les affaires morbides, Archibald choisit sagement : ces armes comptent parmi les plus efficaces."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:854
msgid "Ideal Crossbow"
msgstr "Arbalète Idéale"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:854
msgid ""
"This is as much a crossbow as it is a work of art -- a sculpture of a dark figure with curved horns for bowstaves. It would be less surprising if it were indeed just a decoration, but it has all the mechanical parts it needs, cleverly worked into the wooden frame. Its origins are unknown, though it is safe to assume it's a product of dark sorcery, and its performance matches its appearance."
msgstr ""
"Améliorées d'une queue de détente et de viseurs, ces arbalètes exceptionnelles sont supérieures à toutes celles fabriquées jusqu'alors. Mais on ignore d'où elles proviennent..."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:855
msgid ""
"Barely more sophisticated than a normal club, the mace is slightly more effective and much more durable."
msgstr ""
"A peine un progrès par rapport au gourdin, la masse est un peu plus efficace et beaucoup plus solide."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:855
msgid "Crude Mace"
msgstr "Masse"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:856
msgid "Spiked Mace"
msgstr "Masse à Pointes"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:856
msgid ""
"This weapon is designed to inflict good damage to both armored and unarmored opponents."
msgstr ""
"Cette arme est conçue pour infliger des dommages non négligeables aux adversaires, qu'ils soient dotés d'une armure ou pas."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:857
msgid ""
"A common mace from Karigor, it displays the same superior quality of all weapons and equipment from that island."
msgstr ""
"Commune sur Karigor, cette masse possède la supériorité de tout ce qui est fabriqué sur cette ile en fait d'armement."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:857
msgid "Zealot Mace"
msgstr "Masse de Fanatique"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:858
msgid ""
"A variation of the mace, the morningstar hits slower but much harder.  The spikes on the ball guarantee recipients will feel the blow, regardless of armor or hide."
msgstr ""
"Dérivée de la masse, la morgenstern frappe plus lentement mais plus durement. Les pointes qui émaillent la boule de métal ne laissent aucune chance à l'adversaire, même s'il est protégé par une armure."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:858
msgid "Dwarven Morningstar"
msgstr "Morgenstern Naine"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:859
msgid ""
"A heavier, more menacing weapon than a morningstar, flails are almost as dangerous to their wielder as they are to opponents.  Flails like this one are of the highest quality, thoroughly enchanted by the Warlock Guild of Nighon."
msgstr ""
"Plus lourd et plus mortel que la morgenstern, le fléau est une arme d'une redoutable efficacité. Celui-ci est de la meilleure qualité grâce à un enchantement de la Guilde des Magiciens de Nighon."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:859
msgid "Supreme Flail"
msgstr "Fléau Suprême"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:86
msgid "Bone Staff"
msgstr "Bâton en os"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:86
msgid ""
"Fashioned from the spinal bones of wyverns and crowned by a dragon's lower spikeplate, these staves are the product of necromantic weaponcraft. It is unusual to find one of these deadly weapons that is not also carrying a powerful enchantment."
msgstr ""
"Fabriqués à partir de colonnes vertébrales de vouivres et couronnés de la plaque hérissée inférieure d’un dragon, ces bâtons sont le résultat de l’armurerie nécromancienne. Il est rare que l’une de ces redoutables armes ne porte pas également un puissant enchantement."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:860
msgid ""
"A crude, tool-like weapon, this hammer includes a wrist chain to prevent it from dropping from your hand."
msgstr ""
"Ce marteau très simple, proche de l'outil, possède un lacet de poignet pour que l'arme n'échappe pas à son utilisateur."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:860
msgid "Makeshift Hammer"
msgstr "Marteau"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:861
msgid "Battle Hammer"
msgstr "Marteau de Guerre"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:861
msgid ""
"This relatively simple hammer's greatest advantages are its low striking area due to the size of the head, and the spike on the reverse which could be used to inflict rather nasty wounds."
msgstr ""
"D'assez bonne qualité, ces marteaux sont fréquemment utilisés par les monstres humanoïdes. Comme chacun sait que les monstres ne fabriquent pas d'armes, la question de leur provenance se pose avec acuité..."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:862
msgid "Dwarven Hammer"
msgstr "Marteau Nain"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:862
msgid ""
"The top of the line for the hammer family of weapons.  This Dwarven hammer was constructed in the forges of Stone City, and every feature is perfect--balance, weight, handle material, head construction--all the best possible with modern metalurgical techniques."
msgstr ""
"Cette arme donne ses lettres de noblesse à la catégorie des marteaux. Fabriquée par les Nains dans les forges de la Cité de Pierre, elle est parfaitement équilibrée et bénéficie des techniques métallurgiques les plus avancées."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:863
msgid ""
"A primitive weapon usable by even the stupidest of monsters.  This club is constructed of Erathian oak."
msgstr ""
"Ce gourdin en chêne est une arme particulièrement primitive que même les monstres les plus stupides sont capables d'utiliser."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:863
msgid "Primitive Club"
msgstr "Gourdin"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:864
msgid ""
"This small club has been fitted with sharp, thorn-like spikes that somewhat make up for its compact size."
msgstr ""
"Plus perfectionnée que le gourdin simple, cette arme à pointes inflige des blessures plus hideuses."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:864
msgid "Thorned Club"
msgstr "Gourdin à Pointes"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:865
msgid "Steel Club"
msgstr "Gourdin d'Acier"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:865
msgid ""
"The symmetry and length of the knob at the end of the club is the only feature that distinguishes this club from a mace.  The balance is good, the construction is solid, but it IS still a club, and you can't expect that much from it.  Probably of Goblin manufacture."
msgstr ""
"La forme de la protubérance qui chapeaute ce gourdin est ce qui le distingue d'une masse. Il est équilibré, solide, mais ce n'est jamais qu'un gourdin, et vous ne pouvez pas en attendre des merveilles. Il a sans doute été construit par des Gobelins."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:866
msgid "Simple Staff"
msgstr "Bâton"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:866
msgid "The staff is the common weapon of the oppressed."
msgstr "Le bâton est l'arme typique des petites gens opprimées."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:867
msgid "Iron Core Staff"
msgstr "Bâton d'Acier"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:867
msgid ""
"This staff has been filled with iron to give a harder punch than an ordinary staff, while appearing to be nothing more than a fancy walking stick.  The wood is polished Ash, carved with a tasteful design."
msgstr ""
"Ce bâton a été alourdi par des éléments de fer pour lui donner plus de puissance tout en lui conférant l'aspect sympathique d'une canne de promenade. La gravure du bois n'est pas sans élégance."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:868
msgid ""
"A weird combination of wood, glass and aluminum form the staff, while a crystalline skull tops it.  The whole weapon is bound together with glue and strong enchantments to make one of the lightest, strongest staves in the world."
msgstr ""
"Etrange mélange de bois, de verre et d'aluminium, ce bâton est surmonté d'un crâne cristallin. L'arme est suffisamment enchantée pour être solide, légère, et efficace."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:868
msgid "Wizard Staff"
msgstr "Bâton de Magicien"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:869
msgid ""
"A weapon of awesome power, almost certainly created during the Time of Wonders."
msgstr ""
"Cette arme d'un pouvoir extraordinaire a sans doute été forgée pendant les Temps des Merveilles."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1669 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1670 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2204
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:869 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:870 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:954
msgid "Ancient Weapon"
msgstr "Arme Archaïque"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/Global.txt:281 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1669 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:869
msgid "Blaster"
msgstr "Blaster"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:87
msgid "Leather Jerkin"
msgstr "Pourpoint en cuir"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:87
msgid ""
"This armor of thick, supple leather studded with brass offers minimal protection against blows."
msgstr ""
"Cette armure en cuir épais et souple, clouté de cuivre, offre une protection minimale contre les coups."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1670 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:870
msgid "Blaster Rifle"
msgstr "Fusil Blaster"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:870
msgid ""
"The finest of personal weapons made during the Time of Wonders, Blaster Rifles can deal death faster than any weapon you have ever seen."
msgstr ""
"Les fusils Blaster sont les armes les plus remarquables fabriquées pendant les Temps des Merveilles. Ils donnent la mort avec une efficacité inégalée."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:871
msgid "Crude Leather Armor"
msgstr "Armure de Cuir"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:871
msgid ""
"Leather armor is the lightest and most easily worn armor, but it offers less protection that the heavier armors.  The leather in this suit was improperly cured and still stinks of the chemicals used in its production."
msgstr ""
"L'armure de cuir est la plus légère et la plus facile à porter de toutes les protections, mais n'est que d'une efficacité limitée. Cette armure de cuir a été maladroitement traitée et empeste encore les produits utilisés dans sa fabrication."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:872
msgid "Studded Leather"
msgstr "Cuir Clouté"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:872
msgid ""
"This suit of leather armor is held together with bronze studs instead of leather straps.  This construction makes it a bit stronger, but also a bit heavier."
msgstr ""
"Cette armure de cuir articulée est assemblée par des pièces de bronze et non des lacets de cuir. Elle est plus solide, mais aussi plus lourde."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:873
msgid ""
"An otherwise ordinary suit of leather armor, this suit is imbued with a subtle enchantment that strengthens the material against blows without increasing weight."
msgstr ""
"Ordinaire dans l'ensemble, cette armure de cuir dispose d'un enchantement subtil qui renforce la protection qu'elle offre contre les flèches sans l'alourdir."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:873
msgid "Officer's Leather"
msgstr "Cuir d'Officier"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:874
msgid "Light Dragon Leather"
msgstr "Cuir de Regna"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:874
msgid ""
"Standard issue leather armor for officers in the Regnan Navy.  All such leather armor receives enchantments to strengthen and lighten it during its creation in the Regnan Armories."
msgstr ""
"C'est l'armure de cuir en dotation dans la Marine de Regna. Toutes les armures de ce type ont été renforcées par un enchantement qui les rend plus efficaces sans les alourdir."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:875
msgid ""
"Only a few suits like this one have been made, and all were special orders for members of the royal family of Erathia--the Gryphonhearts.  This one had to come from one of three places:  Stolen from the palace armory, taken on the battlefield, or robbed from a grave."
msgstr ""
"Peu de protections de cette sorte ont été faites et toutes ont été commandées par la famille royale d'Erathia, les Gryphonheart. Celle-ci ne peut provenir que de l'armurerie du palais, d'un champ de bataille ou d'une tombe profanée."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:875
msgid "Royal Leather"
msgstr "Cuir Royal"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1676 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1677 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1678
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1679 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1680 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:876
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:877 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:878 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:879
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:880
msgid "Chain Mail"
msgstr "Cotte de Mailles"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:876
msgid ""
"Chain mail is an armor formed of small, interlocking loops of metal.  It looks like someone forgot to oil the rings, or maybe left it out in the rain because rust has begun to form in the armpits and under the collars."
msgstr ""
"La Cotte de mailles est une armure formée de petits anneaux de métal entrelacés. Celle-ci a sans doute été oubliée sous la pluie, car de la rouille commence à gangrener l'encolure et les emmanchements."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:876
msgid "Disheveled Chain Mail"
msgstr "Cotte de Mailles"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:877
msgid "Quality Steel Chain Mail"
msgstr "Cotte de Mailles d'Acier"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:877
msgid ""
"This suit of chain mail is made of steel and is actually lighter than similar suits made of plain iron.  Thin rings were used in its construction, but the steel composition makes them very strong."
msgstr ""
"Cette Cotte de mailles est constituée d'acier et pèse moins que celles faites de simple fer. Les anneaux utilisés sont très minces mais très solides."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:878
msgid "Fine Chain Mail"
msgstr "Belle Cotte de Mailles"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:878
msgid ""
"Very high quality steel is reinforced with fine studded leather to soften blows while minimizing weight.  The leather portions are quite artistic and pleasing to the eye."
msgstr ""
"Un cuir fin est entremêlé à un acier de haute qualité pour faire de cette Cotte de mailles une armure légère et efficace. Les pièces de cuir sont artistiquement travaillées."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:879
msgid ""
"A distinctive suit of armor meant to aid recognition of officers during battle.  Besides just looking good, the armor is amongst the lightest, most supple chain mail available."
msgstr ""
"Cette Cotte de mailles est dessinée de façon à permettre la reconnaissance facile des officiers sur les champs de bataille. Admirablement ouvragée, cette armure est aussi légère et souple."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:879
msgid "Resplendent Chain Mail"
msgstr "Cotte de Mailles Resplendissante"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:88
msgid "Hardened Leather Vest"
msgstr "Gilet en cuir durci"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:88
msgid ""
"This item of leather armor has been hardened to offer increased protection. It is comfortable and light though offers little coverage."
msgstr ""
"Cette pièce d’armure en cuir a été durcie pour offrir une meilleure protection. Elle est confortable et légère, bien qu’elle ne couvre qu’une petite surface du corps."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:880
msgid ""
"A very rare suit of armor turned out by the Heavenly Forges of Governor Padish before the Silence.  The armor was originally worn strictly by the Governor's highest military officers as a badge of office.  It is not just for show; this chain mail is lighter, stronger, and more supple than any other chain in the world."
msgstr ""
"Cette armure d'un type rare provient des Forges Célestes du gouverneur Padish d'avant le Silence. Seuls ses plus hauts officiers la portaient initialement comme marque de leur rang. Cependant, ce n'est pas qu'une protection de parade : elle est plus légère, plus solide et plus souple qu'aucune autre dans le monde."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:880
msgid "Golden Chain Mail"
msgstr "Cotte de Mailles d'Or"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:881
msgid ""
"Plate armor is the strongest armor available.  It is much heavier than other suits of armor, and requires considerable practice to get used to wearing.  This suit is made of iron, and the workmanship is unremarkable."
msgstr ""
"L'armure de plaques est la protection la plus solide qui soit. Beaucoup plus lourde que les autres, elle demande de la pratique avant d'être utilisée efficacement. Celle-ci est faite de fer et sa construction est assez banale."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:882
msgid ""
"Forged in an Erathian armory, this suit of plate armor bears a recent stamp:  B.R., Steadwick Foundry, 1151.  The initials are those of Byron Rockermann, Royal armorsmith of Erathia.  His work is competent and elegant."
msgstr ""
"Forgée dans les armureries d'Erathia, cette armure de plaques porte un poinçon récent : B.R., Fonderie Steadwick, 1151. Les initiales sont celles de Byron Rockermann, Armurier Royal d'Erathia. Son travail est fin et esthétique."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:882
msgid "Splendid Plate Armor"
msgstr "Armure de Plaques Splendide"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:883
msgid ""
"A suit of armor so fine could only have come from the forge of the Master himself--Mekorig the Blind.  Indeed, this one bears the initials of his son, Kasev Mekorig near the heel.  The joints move easily, and the metal has a curious triple plated construction that makes it thin and light, yet incredibly strong.  Padding in comfortable, too."
msgstr ""
"Une armure si remarquable ne peut provenir que de la forge du Maître parmi les Maîtres : Mekorig l'Aveugle. Elle porte en fait les initiales de son fils Kasev Mekorig. La lame est faîte d'une curieuse construction en feuilles d'acier triples qui la rend beaucoup plus légère et beaucoup plus solide."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:883
msgid "Noble Plate Armor"
msgstr "Armure de Plaques Noble"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:884
msgid ""
"A simple, old shield with crude markings on its face.  Ugly, but practical."
msgstr ""
"Voici un bouclier primitif hâtivement décoré. Laid mais pas inefficace."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:884
msgid "Goblin Shield"
msgstr "Bouclier Gobelin"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:885
msgid ""
"This shield is made of wood framed by iron.  It is heavy, but well constructed and in good condition."
msgstr ""
"Ce bouclier est fait de bois sur une structure de fer. Il est lourd mais habilement fabriqué et toujours en bon état."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:885
msgid "Wooden Shield"
msgstr "Bouclier de Bois"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:886
msgid "Horseman's Shield"
msgstr "Bouclier de Cavalier"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:886
msgid ""
"Narrow and tapered at the bottom, this shield is intended for battle on horseback, but will work just fine on foot.  Construction is tight and materials are tough--it should be able to resist a direct spear thrust."
msgstr ""
"Etroit et conique en son extrémité basse, ce bouclier est conçu pour être porté à cheval pendant les batailles, mais peut convenir à un fantassin. La construction est assez solide théoriquement pour résister à un coup de lance direct."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1687 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:887
msgid ""
"Made of a lightweight metal, this shield has a foundry stamp from the Kelebrim armory.  Though light, the material is very strong, and the metal is welded almost seamlessly."
msgstr ""
"Fait de métal léger, ce bouclier porte le sceau de la fonderie Kelebrim. Quoique léger, le matériau en est solide et soudé de façon parfaite."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:887
msgid "Sterling Shield"
msgstr "Bouclier de Bon Aloi"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:888
msgid "Phynaxian Shield"
msgstr "Bouclier Phynaxien"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
# fan text corrected (Claude)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:888
msgid ""
"These shields were forged by the Phynaxian empire during its brief rise to power on the steppes of southern Erathia (790-864).  They are made of stalt, a metal that takes well to enchantment, and contributed heavily to Phynaxian military might.  Unfortunately, very little of the metal could be mined, and Phynaxia fell in 864 A.S. to an Elvish offensive."
msgstr ""
"Ces boucliers furent fabriqués par l'Empire Phynaxien pendant sa brève montée en puissance le long des steppes au sud d'Erathia (790-864). Ils sont faits de stalt, un métal qui convient particulièrement bien aux enchantements, et ont contribué à la puissance militaire phynaxienne. Malheureusement dur à extraire, ce métal précieux n'a pas pu empêcher les Phynaxiens de chuter sous les coups de boutoir des Elfes en 864 A.S."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:889
msgid ""
"A small wood buckler designed to protect against arrows without encumbering its wielder.  The quality is amaturish, but it's in good condition and will serve its purpose."
msgstr ""
"Ce petit écu de bois a été conçu pour protéger des flèches sans alourdir son possesseur. Il est de qualité médiocre mais en bon état et il peut encore remplir son rôle."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:889
msgid "Crude Buckler"
msgstr "Ecu de Bois"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:89
msgid "Caravaner's Leather"
msgstr "Cuir de caravanier"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:89
msgid ""
"This is the type of armor worn most often by those guarding Alverian merchant caravans. A hardened and internally braced breastplate covers an undersuit of tough but supple hide, offering the wearer full body protection with a minimal hampering of movement."
msgstr ""
"Il s’agit du type d’armure portée le plus souvent par les gardes des caravanes des marchands d’Alvar. Un plastron durci et renforcé de l’intérieur couvre une combinaison de peau résistante mais souple. Il offre une protection intégrale du corps et entrave au minimum les mouvements."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:890
msgid "Bronze Shield"
msgstr "Bouclier de Bronze"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:890
msgid ""
"Bronze shields are lighter than iron shields of the same size, but aren't nearly as strong. This particular one is of a slightly larger variety and has been reasonably well protected from rusting."
msgstr ""
"Les boucliers de bronze sont plus légers mais moins solides que les boucliers de fer de même taille."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:891
msgid "Metal Shield"
msgstr "Bouclier de Métal"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:891
msgid ""
"The pretty red design on the surface of this shield means it's from Deyja, and the paint isn't paint.  Emulsifiers and preservatives help to retain the original color…"
msgstr ""
"Le joli dessin rouge sur la surface de ce bouclier indique sa provenance : Deyja. La couleur d'origine est conservée par des émulsifiants et des produits de fixation."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:892
msgid "Alloyed Shield"
msgstr "Bouclier d'Alliage"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:892
msgid ""
"The exact mixture of metals in these strong shields has been lost for hundreds of years.  Attempts to rediscover the process used to make them have been miserable failures.  There is absolutely nothing enchanted or magical about these shields--any enchantment they carry was added after they were created."
msgstr ""
"La composition exacte des métaux mélangés dans l'alliage de ce bouclier a été perdue depuis longtemps. La plupart des tentatives pour la retrouver se sont soldées par des échecs spectaculaires. Ces boucliers-là n'ont rien de magique dans leur composition initiale, mais un enchantement a pu leur être ajouté ensuite."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:893
msgid "Majestic Shield"
msgstr "Bouclier Majestueux"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:893
msgid ""
"The dark, golden color of these shields is actually a flaw.  About fifty of these shields were turned out by the Heavenly Forge as it began to fail.  Although imperfect, they are second only to shields built by the Forge in its prime."
msgstr ""
"La couleur or sombre de ces boucliers est en fait une erreur de fabrication. Environ une cinquantaine de ces boucliers ont été construits par les Forges Célestes avant que la production ne soit interrompue. Encore qu'imparfaits, ils ne sont surpassés que par les boucliers fabriqués par la même forge dans ses plus hauts moments de gloire."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:894
msgid "Horned Helm"
msgstr "Casque à Cornes"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:894
msgid ""
"This cheap helm is better suited for a costume party than a battle.  The horns have been glued onto a rigid leather cap dyed black to make it look scarier.  The material is brittle and flaky, and will probably come apart at just the wrong time."
msgstr ""
"Ce casque bon marché convient mieux à un bal costumé qu'à un combat. Les cornes, collées à un morceau de cuir, ne sont là que dans l'espoir d'effrayer l'ennemi. L'ensemble ne résisterait même pas à une bourrade amicale."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:895
msgid "Conscript's Helm"
msgstr "Casque de Conscrit"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:895
msgid ""
"The simple style and uniformity of these helms is meant to strike terror into the hearts of enemies when they see row upon row of bronze, spiked helms marching toward them."
msgstr ""
"Ces casques furent conçus délibérément uniformes et simples : l'ennemi confronté à une mer de bronze et de pointes roulant vers lui ne peut que paniquer."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:896
msgid "Elven Helm"
msgstr "Casque de Garde"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:896
msgid ""
"This helm design has been used by the Elves of Erathia since before the Silence.  It is composed of silver and steel and is very strong."
msgstr ""
"Ce dessin de casque est fréquent chez les Elfes d'Erathia depuis des temps immémoriaux. Il est fait d'argent et d'acier et sa solidité est à toute épreuve."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:897
msgid "Phynaxian Helm"
msgstr "Casque Phynaxien"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:897
msgid ""
"Worn by Phynaxian Dragoons during the expansion of their empire a few hundred years ago, these helms are tough, flexible, and light.  They are made of two strips of dragonhide bound together with stalt metal studs."
msgstr ""
"Portés par les Dragons Phynaxiens pendant l'expansion de leur empire il y a quelques centaines d'années, ces casques sont solides, légers et faciles à porter. Ils sont faits de deux morceaux de cuir de dragon reliés par des charnières de stalt."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:898
msgid ""
"Half made from the skull of the ferocious Mogred beast in Karigor, these helms grow more uncommon every year as the Mogreds approach extinction.  Two poisonous spines used to grow from the red spots on the front of the helm."
msgstr ""
"Partiellement faits d'un crâne de mogred, féroce carnassier de Karigor, ces casques se font plus rares au fur et à mesure que les mogreds disparaissent. Deux épines empoisonnées poussaient autrefois à l'emplacement des taches rouges sur le devant du casque."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:898
msgid "Mogred Helm"
msgstr "Casque Mogred"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:899
msgid ""
"A common, cloth hat with a feather stuck in the band to add a dash of style."
msgstr ""
"Voici un simple chapeau d'habillement décoré d'une plume pour l'élégance de l'ensemble."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:899
msgid "Peasant Hat"
msgstr "Chapeau de Paysan"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:9
msgid "Iron Two-Handed Sword"
msgstr "Epée à deux mains"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:9
msgid ""
"This blade's great weight and length give its blows greater reach and damage. Otherwise, it is unexceptional in quality."
msgstr ""
"La masse et la longueur considérables de cette lame lui permettent de frapper plus loin et plus fort. A part cela, sa qualité n’a rien d’exceptionnel."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:10 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:11 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:12
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:13 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1375 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1611
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1612 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1613 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:811
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:812 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:813 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:9
msgid "Two-Handed Sword"
msgstr "Epée à deux mains"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:90
msgid "Regnan Leather"
msgstr "Cuir regnan"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:90
msgid ""
"Though seemingly too thin to offer solid protection, this armor of Regnan design holds a subtle enchantment which makes the leather nearly steel tough. Additionally, a secret process makes the suit resistant to salt water corrosion."
msgstr ""
"Apparemment trop fine pour offrir une protection efficace, cette armure de style regnan possède cependant un enchantement subtil. Le cuir en est presque aussi résistant que l’acier. En outre, un procédé secret la rend résistante à la corrosion par l’eau salée."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:900
msgid "A simple hat meant to keep sun and dust off a traveller's head."
msgstr ""
"Ce chapeau simple est destiné à protéger le voyageur du soleil et de la poussière."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:900
msgid "Traveller's Hat"
msgstr "Chapeau de Voyageur"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:901
msgid "Fancy Hat"
msgstr "Chapeau Elégant"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:901
msgid ""
"The latest in fashion, this hat harkens back to more of a working class style.  It isn't really the hat that's in style, it's the working man that young nobles are trying to emulate--who in turn seeks to emulate the nobleman…"
msgstr ""
"Dernière mode officielle, ce chapeau plutôt snob imite le style des travailleurs. Il est très prisé des jeunes aristocrates."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1702 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1703 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1704
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:902 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:903 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:904
msgid "Crown"
msgstr "Couronne"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:902
msgid ""
"This is a cheap crown of the sort that primitive goblins wear to mock human customs.  The metal is bronze, and the gem is made of glass."
msgstr ""
"Voici une couronne bon marché fabriquée par les Gobelins pour singer ironiquement les coutumes humaines. Elle est faite de bronze et n'est décorée que de verroterie."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:903
msgid ""
"A fine, if somewhat ostentatious crown made with gold leaf and large, high quality amethysts.  It suits nobles of your station well."
msgstr ""
"Cette jolie couronne, peut-être un peu voyante, est plaquée de feuilles d'or et enchâssée d'améthystes. Elle est très appréciée des aristocrates."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:903
msgid "Noble Crown"
msgstr "Couronne Noble"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:904
msgid ""
"Crowns such as this are what you might find adorning the heads of genuine royalty. Not only do they look elegant without being gaudy, but they're perfectly suited to taking the strongest of enchantments."
msgstr ""
"Les couronnes de ce genre ont été forgées spécialement pour les rendre plus dociles à l'enchantement. Si la couronne que l'on trouve n'est pas enchantée, c'est que pour une raison ou une autre la fabrication a été arrêtée avant la fin."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:904
msgid "Royal Crown"
msgstr "Couronne Royale"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:905
msgid ""
"A peasant's belt.  This one is made of poorly cured leather and rusting iron studs."
msgstr ""
"Une ceinture de paysan est faite en général de cuir grossier et d'une simple boucle de fer."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:905
msgid "Leather Belt"
msgstr "Ceinture de Cuir"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:906
msgid ""
"A well crafted belt of well tanned leather and fine stitching.  The buckle is made of polished silver."
msgstr ""
"Cette ceinture est de bonne facture, constituée de cuir soigneusement tanné. La boucle est d'argent poli."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:906
msgid "Fine Belt"
msgstr "Belle Ceinture"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:907
msgid ""
"A tough, yet high quality leather belt.  This one was probably made in western Erathia."
msgstr ""
"Voici une ceinture au cuir dur mais d'excellente qualité. Elle provient probablement de l'ouest d'Erathia."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:907
msgid "Strong Belt"
msgstr "Ceinture Forte"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:908
msgid ""
"A very nicely made silver belt, this one is old, but well cared for.  There's no trace of tarnish on any of the links--just a bit of wear around the buckle."
msgstr ""
"Cette jolie ceinture d'argent n'est plus jeune, mais elle a été visiblement bien entretenue. Il n'y a pas de rouille aux charnières, la boucle seule est un peu passée."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:908
msgid "Silver Belt"
msgstr "Ceinture d'Argent"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:909
msgid ""
"Gaudy to an extreme, this belt is made of solid 14-karat gold.  Each link has a different, low quality image stamped on its face.  Tasteless, but valuable."
msgstr ""
"Du plus parfait mauvais goût, cette ceinture est faite d'or 14 carats. Chaque plaquette est gravée d'une image différente, d'ailleurs médiocre. Heureusement, la valeur pécuniaire d'un objet ne se mesure pas toujours à son raffinement artistique."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:909
msgid "Gilded Belt"
msgstr "Ceinture Dorée"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:91
msgid "Alvarian Leather"
msgstr "Cuir d’Alvar"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:91
msgid ""
"Leather armor sets of this quality are of the finest produced by the Alvarian Armorers' Guild. The stalt-alloy edged panels are virtually inpenetrable; their clever interlockings give the wearer excellent freedom of movement."
msgstr ""
"Les armures en cuir de cette qualité sont les meilleures de la Guilde des armuriers d’Alvar. Les plaques bordées d’alliage de stalt sont quasiment impénétrables ; astucieusement imbriquées, elles offrent une excellente liberté de mouvement."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:910
msgid "A simple traveller's cloak."
msgstr "C'est une simple cape de voyage."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:910
msgid "Fine Leather Cloak"
msgstr "Cape de Cuir"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:911
msgid ""
"A huntsman's cloak colored green to make the wearer difficult to see in the forest.  Not much to look at, but it serves its purpose."
msgstr ""
"Cette cape de chasse est camouflée en vert pour rendre le porteur invisible en forêt."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:911
msgid "Huntsman's Cloak"
msgstr "Cape de Chasseur"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:912
msgid "Ranger's Cloak"
msgstr "Cape de Trappeur"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:912
msgid ""
"Woven from plant fibers found in the Tularean Forest, these cloaks are the traditional garb of the Elven Rangers. This black variety is reserved for higher ranking Rangers and symbolizes their status as leaders."
msgstr ""
"Tissées de fibres de plantes trouvées dans la forêt de Tulare, ces capes sont les costumes traditionnels des trappeurs Elfes."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:913
msgid "Elegant Cloak"
msgstr "Cape Elégante"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:913
msgid ""
"This cloak is of the quality preferred by wealthy nobles and royalty.  It is hard to find better."
msgstr ""
"Cette cape possède la qualité appréciée par les classes supérieures et les familles princières. Il n'en est pas de meilleures."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:914
msgid ""
"Almost all cloaks like this one come with some sort of enchantment.  The Warlocks of Nighon employ legions of mentally enslaved people to perform the tedious weaving and ritual spell casting necessary to make these cloaks."
msgstr ""
"Presque toutes les capes de cette sorte sont enchantées. Les géomanciens de Nighon emploient des légions de travailleurs asservis par les pouvoirs de l'esprit pour travailler au tissage et aux jets de sorts rituels requis."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:914
msgid "Glorious Cloak"
msgstr "Cape de Gloire"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:915
msgid "Low quality iron gauntlets with cloth linings to prevent blisters."
msgstr ""
"Voici des gantelets de fer de mauvaise qualité avec un doublage de tissus pour éviter les cloques."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:915
msgid "Pinched Gauntlets"
msgstr "Gantelets"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:916
msgid ""
"This pair of gauntlets is made of steel and decorated with brass tracery along the outside of the palm and back of the hand.  It is in good repair and well oiled."
msgstr ""
"Ces gantelets sont faits d'acier et décorés avec des linéaments de cuivre sur la paume et le revers de la main. Ils sont bien entretenus et huilés."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:917
msgid ""
"A marvelous achievement, these gauntlets were forged and woven by the Dwarves of Stone City.  The offer both flexibility and strong protection.  The only trouble is that the wearer's skin is sometimes caught in the mesh, leading to painful pinches."
msgstr ""
"Ces merveilleux gantelets ont été forgés par les Nains à la Cité de Pierre. Ils sont faciles d'emploi et offrent une bonne protection. On peut tout au plus regretter que leurs articulations mordent parfois la peau des mains."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:917
msgid "Silver Mesh Gauntlets"
msgstr "Gantelets en Mailles d'Argent"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:918
msgid "Dragon Hide Gauntlets"
msgstr "Gantelets en Ecailles de Dragon"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:918
msgid ""
"Dragon hide -- as can be expected -- makes for an outstanding material for gauntlets, offering hand protection surpassing many simpler iron or steel designs. The only downside is that the leather is thick and rigid, somewhat limiting the dexterity of movements."
msgstr ""
"Ces gantelets de bonne facture sont souples et solides. Les jointures ont été renforcées mais restent assez flexibles pour permettre un fonctionnement agile de la main."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:919
msgid ""
"Made from the hide of the Mogred beast on Karigor, these gauntlets are tough, supple, and magic resistant.  The two red spots used to have poisonous spines growing from them."
msgstr ""
"Fabriqués avec le cuir du carnassier connu à Karigor sous le nom de mogred, ces gantelets sont solides, souples et renforcés magiquement. Les deux marques rouges sont le reste d'épines empoisonnées."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:919
msgid "Mogred Gauntlets"
msgstr "Gantelets Mogred"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:92 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:93 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:94
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:95 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:96
msgid "Chainmail"
msgstr "Cotte de mailles"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:92
msgid "Rusty Mail Vest"
msgstr "Gilet de mailles rouillé"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:92
msgid ""
"This corroded ring mail vest has seen better days. It has been field repaired in many places and even has a large patch of thinner mail salvaged from a piece of chain cowl."
msgstr ""
"Ce gilet d’anneaux entrelacés, rongé par la corrosion, n’est plus en très bon état. Rafistolé à de nombreux endroits, il a même une grande pièce de mailles plus fines, récupérée dans un morceau de capuchon de mailles."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:920
msgid "Leather Boots"
msgstr "Bottes de Cuir"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:920
msgid ""
"These boots are made of soft leather for a more comfortable fit, but they offer little protection in combat."
msgstr ""
"Ces bottes sont de cuir souple et tiennent bien aux pieds, mais n'offrent guère de protection."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:921
msgid "Steel Plated Boots"
msgstr "Bottes de Plaques d'Acier"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:921
msgid ""
"This pair of leather boots has been fitted with steel plates on the top of the foot and at the shin."
msgstr ""
"Cette paire de bottes de cuir a un talon et une semelle renforcés par des plaques d'acier."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:922
msgid ""
"A quality set of Erathian leather boots.  This pair has the usual features of Erathian leather craftsmanship:  Soft, water resistant, and quiet."
msgstr ""
"Ce sont de belles bottes de cuir érathien. L'habileté des tanneurs d'Erathia est connue, produisant des cuirs souples, silencieux et étanches."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:922
msgid "Ranger Boots"
msgstr "Bottes de Pisteur"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:923
msgid "Knight's Boots"
msgstr "Bottes de Chevalier"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1723 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:923
msgid ""
"Polished silver boots with velvet interiors, these boots are lighter than steel boots and far more comfortable.  They look pretty snappy, too."
msgstr ""
"Ces bottes sont d'argent poli doublé de velours à l'intérieur. Elles sont beaucoup plus légères et beaucoup plus confortables que les bottes d'acier. Elles ont aussi un air assez chic."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:924
msgid ""
"Made in the forge of Byron Rockermann, these silver and steel boots are amongst the best in the world.  The are enormously strong, yet fit comfortable and flexibly in all the right spots."
msgstr ""
"Issues de la forge de Byron Rockermann, ces bottes d'argent et d'acier sont parmi les meilleures du monde. Elles sont incroyablement solides et offrent autant de souplesse que de confort."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:924
msgid "Paladin Boots"
msgstr "Bottes de Paladin"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:925
msgid ""
"A tarnished brass ring.  Polished up, you might be able to sell it for something…but don't expect much."
msgstr ""
"Cet anneau de cuivre terne peut être monnayé une fois poli, mais sûrement pas pour une fortune."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:925
msgid "Brass Ring"
msgstr "Anneau de Cuivre"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:926
msgid ""
"A large, imperfect pearl adorns this otherwise unremarkable gold ring."
msgstr ""
"Cet anneau d'or assez médiocre n'est relevé que par sa grosse perle imparfaite."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:927
msgid ""
"At first glance silver, this ring is actually made of platinum.  The gemstone is a small, flawed diamond."
msgstr ""
"Cet anneau n'est pas d'argent, comme on pourrait le croire au premier coup d'œil, mais de platine. Le joyau est un petit diamant."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:927
msgid "Platinum Ring"
msgstr "Anneau de Platine"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:928
msgid "A large, cut emerald adorns an otherwise plain silver ring."
msgstr "Cet anneau d'argent est décoré d'une belle émeraude taillée."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:928
msgid "Emerald Ring"
msgstr "Anneau d'Emeraude"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:929
msgid "Sapphire Ring"
msgstr "Anneau de Saphir"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:929
msgid ""
"Three small sapphires are mounted at the top of this silver and gold ring.  Rings of this quality are often enchanted."
msgstr ""
"Trois petits saphirs sont enchâssés dans cet anneau d'or et d'argent. Les anneaux de cette qualité sont généralement enchantés."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:93
msgid ""
"Constructed of strong steel this is the type of armor worn by the rank and file foot soldiers of many armies."
msgstr ""
"Faite d'acier solide, cette armure est celle que portent les simples fantassins de nombreuses armées."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:93
msgid "Steel Chainmail"
msgstr "Cotte de mailles de minotaure"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:930
msgid ""
"This complex and gaudy arrangement of amethysts on platinum can be appealing, if you like that sort of thing."
msgstr ""
"Ce subtil dessin d'améthyste et de platine peut plaire, si vous n'avez pas des goûts trop sobres."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:930
msgid "Warlock's Ring"
msgstr "Anneau de Sorcier"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:931
msgid ""
"A rare gem-within-gem of emerald and garnet is set upon a fine gold ring."
msgstr ""
"Cet anneau d'or est enchâssé de deux pierres l'une dans l'autre dans une rare combinaison d'émeraude et de grenat."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:931
msgid "Enchanted Ring"
msgstr "Anneau Enchanté"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:932
msgid ""
"A beautiful rosetta of rubies and emeralds on gold backing.  The ring itself is platinum."
msgstr ""
"Une rosace de rubis et d'émeraudes embellit cet anneau de platine serti d'or."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:932
msgid "Dazzling Ring"
msgstr "Anneau Etincelant"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:933
msgid ""
"Three perfect garnets set into silver belie the enchantments used to create this ring.  Handling the ring for long makes your hand tingle."
msgstr ""
"Trois grenats très purs enchâssés dans de l'argent garantissent les enchantements utilisés pour la confection de cet anneau. A le porter trop longtemps, on finit par avoir des fourmis dans les doigts."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:933
msgid "Wizard Ring"
msgstr "Anneau de Magicien"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:934
msgid ""
"A very strange brown stone (petrified wood?) is mounted on a metal that looks like gold, but is much lighter."
msgstr ""
"Une très étrange pierre brune (du bois pétrifié peut-être) est montée sur un anneau de métal qui évoque l'or mais qui est beaucoup plus léger."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:934
msgid "Angel's Ring"
msgstr "Anneau Angélique"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:935
msgid "Eyeball Amulet"
msgstr "Amulette Oculaire"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:935
msgid ""
"This strange amulet has a glass eye on the end of a cheap brass chain.  A novelty, but probably not worth much."
msgstr ""
"Cette étrange amulette possède un œil de verre à l'extrémité d'une chaîne de cuivre bon marché. Une curiosité qui ne vaut sans doute pas grand-chose."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:936
msgid ""
"A baroque bronze amulet with an ill define image stamped on the face.  Cheap, and tasteless."
msgstr ""
"Cette amulette de bronze baroque est gravée d'un dessin primitif. Elle est bon marché, et assez grossière."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:936
msgid "Bronze Amulet"
msgstr "Amulette de Bronze"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:937
msgid ""
"A plaster cast of a baby's hand was used to form this strange silver amulet.  There is some unidentifiable symbol stamped in the center of the amulet."
msgstr ""
"Le moulage d'une main de bébé a été utilisé pour constituer cette étrange amulette. Des symboles indéchiffrables sont gravés en son centre."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:937
msgid "Witch's Amulet"
msgstr "Amulette de Sorcière"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:938
msgid "Death's Head Pendant"
msgstr "Pendentif à Tête de Mort"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:938
msgid ""
"Straight out of Deyja, this is just the sort of thing you would expect from Necromancers.  The silver skull in the center is modeled from a real, shrunken skull, and the tiny rubies in the eyes glow in the dark."
msgstr ""
"Cet objet, tout droit venu de Deyja, est le genre de choses que vous attendez d'un Nécromancien. Le crâne d'argent au centre est modelé d'après une véritable tête réduite et les petits rubis oculaires luisent dans l'obscurité."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:939
msgid ""
"A glorious gold amulet with the ancient symbol of the sun in the center.  The amulet is from Karigor, and the craftsmanship is flawless."
msgstr ""
"C'est une ancienne amulette gravée du symbole solaire. Elle provient de Karigor et sa confection est grossière."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:939
msgid "Sun Amulet"
msgstr "Amulette Solaire"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:94
msgid "Minotaur Chainmail"
msgstr "Cotte de mailles d’acier"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:94
msgid ""
"Of a design originally created by the Minotaurs for their Vori campaigns, this type of chainmail, with its good coverage and fine construction, has proven popular among other races. Now the armorsmiths of Bathazar Lair construct it in sizes for any with ready gold to spend."
msgstr ""
"En acier solide, c’est le type d’armure portée par les légions de fantassins de nombreuses armées."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:940 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:941 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:942
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:943 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:944
msgid ""
"The magical process that was used to enchant this wand turned it sky blue.  It's made of wood and glass.  To use this wand, you must equip it as though you were equipping a weapon."
msgstr ""
"Le processus magique utilisé pour enchanter cette baguette l'a colorée en bleu azur. Elle est faite de bois et de verre. Pour utiliser cette baguette, vous devez vous en équiper à la place de votre arme principale."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:940
msgid "Wand of Fire"
msgstr "Baguette de Feu"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:941
msgid "Wand of Sparks"
msgstr "Baguette d'Etincelles"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:942
msgid "Wand of Poison"
msgstr "Baguette de Poison"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:943
msgid "Wand of Stunning"
msgstr "Baguette d'Etourdissement"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:944
msgid "Wand of Harm"
msgstr "Baguette de Blessure"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:945 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:946 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:947
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:948 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:949
msgid ""
"A wooden wand painted green and banded with brass.  The wand is capped with a large, flawed emerald.  To use this wand, you must equip it as though you were equipping a weapon."
msgstr ""
"C'est une baguette de bois peinte en vert et cerclée de cuivre. Une large émeraude l'enrichit. Pour utiliser cette baguette, vous devez vous en équiper à la place de votre arme principale."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:945
msgid "Fairy Wand of Light"
msgstr "Baguette Magique de Lumière"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:946
msgid "Fairy Wand of Ice"
msgstr "Baguette Magique de Glace"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:947
msgid "Fairy Wand of Lashing"
msgstr "Baguette Magique de Souffle"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:948
msgid "Fairy Wand of Mind"
msgstr "Baguette Magique de l'Esprit"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:949
msgid "Fairy Wand of Swarms"
msgstr "Baguette Magique de Nuée"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:95
msgid "Siertal Chainmail"
msgstr "Cotte de mailles en siertal"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:95
msgid ""
"The Alvarian Dark Elves guard their siertal-alloy formula carefully. Chainmail made from this metal is both light and capable of turning the hardest blades."
msgstr ""
"Les elfes de l’Ombre d’Alvar gardent jalousement la formule de leur alliage de siertal. Les cottes de mailles constituées de ce métal sont à la fois légères et capables de tordre les lames les plus dures."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:950
msgid "Alacorn Wand of Fireballs"
msgstr "Baguette Alacorn de Boule de Feu"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:950 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:951 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:952
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:953 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:954
msgid ""
"Made from the hollowed out horn of a unicorn and capped with a spiked brass ball, wands like these are born of cruelty and evil.  The enchantment it holds is useful;  the only real question is whether you believe your cause justifies the use of an item so wickedly created.  To use this wand, you must equip it as though you were equipping a weapon."
msgstr ""
"Fabriquées dans une corne de licorne et surmontées par une boule de cuivre bardée de pointes, ces baguettes servent le mal le plus cruel. L'enchantement qui les nimbe est utile, mais votre cause vaut-elle de risquer votre âme avec ces objets maudits ? Pour utiliser cette baguette, vous devez vous en équiper à la place de votre arme principale."

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:951
msgid "Alacorn Wand of Acid"
msgstr "Baguette Alacorn d'Acide"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:952
msgid "Alacorn Wand of Lightning"
msgstr "Baguette Alacorn d'Eclair"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:953
msgid "Alacorn Wand of Blades"
msgstr "Baguette Alacorn de Lame"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:954
msgid "Alacorn Wand of Charms"
msgstr "Baguette Alacorn de Charme"

# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:955 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:956 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:957
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:958 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:959
msgid ""
"A wand of polished ebony capped with the shrunken, bejeweled head of a fallen enemy.  These wands can hold very strong enchantments.  To use this wand, you must equip it as though you were equipping a weapon."
msgstr ""
"Cette baguette d'ébène poli est chapeautée du crâne réduit et serti de joyaux d'un ennemi mort. Ces baguettes possèdent des enchantements puissants.  Pour utiliser cette baguette, vous devez vous en équiper à la place de votre arme principale."

