# imported from FR (MMMerge localization)
# address made plural (Claude)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1265 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5146
msgid ""
"Ton Agraynel, Master Merchant of Alvar, can instruct you in the Grand Master skills of a Dark Elf.\n"
"You will have to prove yourself worthy of his instruction, but the benefits are well worth the effort."
msgstr ""
"Ton Agraynel, maître et marchand d’Alvar, peut vous former aux compétences de grand maître en aptitude d’elfe de l’Ombre. Vous aurez à vous montrer dignes de son enseignement mais les bénéfices retirés justifieront les efforts dépensés."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:180 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:532 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5150
