msgid "Fire Magic Book"
msgstr "Livre de magie du Feu"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/items_patch.txt:833
msgid ""
"A scorched grimoire that radiates gentle heat; a heat-seal brands the cover, and the pages grow too hot to hold unless you're versed in Fire."
msgstr ""
"Un grimoire roussi qui dégage une douce chaleur ; un sceau de feu marque la couverture, et les pages deviennent trop brûlantes pour être tenues à moins d’être versé dans le Feu."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/items_patch.txt:835
msgid "Air Magic Book"
msgstr "Livre de magie de l’Air"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/items_patch.txt:845
msgid ""
"Feather-light pages hum with static; a whirling air-sigil scatters the lines to the wind, settling only for one trained in Air."
msgstr ""
"Des pages légères comme une plume bourdonnent d’électricité statique ; un sigle d’air tourbillonnant disperse les lignes au vent, et elles ne se posent que pour qui est formé à l’Air."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/items_patch.txt:847
msgid "Water Magic Book"
msgstr "Livre de magie de l’Eau"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/items_patch.txt:85
msgid ""
"A crafting gem of tier 7. On the Workbench (Crafting) it raises whichever base enchantment of a weapon, armour piece or jewel is furthest below its cap by 3, or a skill by 1; the cap grows with the tier. Three gems of a tier combine into one of the next."
