"Each point raises the damage of the axe, Armsmaster and special abilities by 2 % (never less than 1 per point). Dwarves and Minotaurs can wield a one-handed axe in the off hand from Expert; Minotaurs hold a two-handed axe in one hand, and in the off hand from Master."
